* ================= Phase 2 - Step 2: one laser current-driver channel =================
* Grounded-anode topology: the DJ532-40 case is the LD anode, so the anode is tied to
* GND (worst case: grounded heatsink) and the current is sunk from the cathode into a
* negative laser rail (VLAS = -3.3 V) through an N-MOSFET and a 1-ohm sense resistor.
*
* Signal chain:  DAC (0-2.5 V, may reach 3.3 V on a fault)
*   -> GATE switch (Pico 2: ENABLE AND camera Status-Expos)
*   -> RC slew limiter (1 k, 2.2 nF, tau = 2.2 us)
*   -> precision clamp to VREF_LIM = 2.5 V (U3 + diode)     => I <= 400 mA in hardware
*   -> buffer U4
*   -> level shifter U2: V = 0.16*Vset + VLAS  (difference amp, ref = VLAS)
*   -> control amp U1 + MOSFET M1 + RS: forces V(S) - VLAS = 0.16*Vset => I = 0.16*Vset/1 ohm
* Protection: antiparallel Schottky across the laser (reverse voltage), TVS, shorting
* relay across the laser while ENABLE is low.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* --- behavioral op-amp: GBW 10 MHz, Aol 100 dB, output 0.2 V from the rails, Rout 50
.subckt OPAMP p n out vcc vee
G1 0 a p n 1m
Ra a 0 100Meg
Ca a 0 15.9p
Da1 a ca DLIM
Va1 ca 0 5
Da2 cb a DLIM
Va2 cb 0 -5
Bo o1 0 V = max(min(v(a), v(vcc)-0.2), v(vee)+0.2)
Ro o1 out 50
.model DLIM D(Is=1e-14 N=0.05)
.ends
* --- logic-level N-MOSFET (generic, Vth 1.5 V, ~SOT-23 class) with explicit capacitances
.model NLL NMOS(Level=1 VTO=1.5 KP=5 LAMBDA=0.01)
.subckt NFET d g s
M1 d g s s NLL
Cgs g s 600p
Cgd g d 120p
.ends
.model DSCH D(Is=1e-6 N=1.05 Rs=0.05 BV=40 Cjo=50p)
.model DCLMP D(Is=1e-12 N=1.0)
.model SWM SW(Ron=0.5 Roff=100Meg Vt=1.65 Vh=0.1)
.model SWR SW(Ron=0.05 Roff=100Meg Vt=1.65 Vh=0.1)
* ---------------- the channel ----------------
* pins: dac gate en anode cathode vlas vp vn
.subckt CHANNEL dac gate en anode cathode vlas vp vn
* gate switch (SPDT): passes DAC when gate=1, grounds the set point when gate=0
* hardware AND (74LVC1G08): the set point is passed only if ENABLE AND GATE are high
V33 v33 0 3.3
Band gq 0 V = 3.3*u(v(gate)-1.65)*u(v(en)-1.65)
S1 dac g1 gq 0 SWM
S2 g1 0 v33 gq SWM
* RC slew limiter
Rsl g1 c 1k
Csl c 0 2.2n
* precision clamp to 2.5 V
Vlim vlim 0 2.5
XU3 vlim c u3o vp vn OPAMP
Dcl c u3o DCLMP
* buffer
XU4 c b b vp vn OPAMP
* level shifter: out = 0.16*(b - 0) + VLAS
R21 b p2 100k
R22 p2 vlas 16k
R23 0 n2 100k
R24 n2 ls 16k
XU2 p2 n2 ls vp vn OPAMP
* control loop
XU1 ls n1 u1o vp vn OPAMP
Rin s n1 1k
Cf u1o n1 2.2n
Rg u1o gt 47
XM1 cathode gt s NFET
RS s vlas 1
* laser-side protection
Dr cathode anode DSCH
Ctv anode cathode 1n
* shorting relay (closed when EN is low)
Ssh anode cathode v33 en SWR
.ends
